<title>USA: PEPCO, Baltimore Gas need merger revision.</title>
<headline>PEPCO, Baltimore Gas need merger revision.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Potomac Electric Power Co said Thursday the Maryland Public Service Commission order issued Wednesday on its merger with Baltimore Gas and Electric Co contains elements that must be revised for the merger to take place.</p>
<p>The companies will file a request for reconsideration of the order so that these problems can be remedied as soon as possible, Pepco said.</p>
</text>
